    "semantic_summary": "OmegaLoggerPanelComponent is a standalone Angular component responsible for rendering and managing a real-time log panel within the editor UI. It actively polls the global EngineLogger service every 250ms to maintain an up-to-date view of system events. Its core logic handles log filtering based on severity levels and manages the expansion state for viewing detailed stack traces."
